# Security headers for elfabulario.com (Cloudflare Pages)
# Apply to every path. CSP intentionally omitted: would need
# careful audit for Spotify embeds, Cloudflare email obfuscation
# and Pagefind. Add later as a separate PR.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), interest-cohort=()
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN

# PWA. El SW no debe quedar cacheado por el navegador/CDN: así los
# despliegues nuevos toman efecto sin esperar a que expire una copia vieja.
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
  Content-Type: text/javascript; charset=utf-8

# Sirve el manifest con el tipo MIME correcto en producción.
/manifest.webmanifest
  Content-Type: application/manifest+json; charset=utf-8
